{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":6286739,"ns":0,"title":"Crawl ratio","extract":"In off-road driving, crawl ratio is the lowest overall gear ratio that a vehicle's drivetrain is capable of, i.e. the slowest vehicle speed for the same engine speed.","description":"Limit of the lowest low gear ratio for offroading","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}